setrate 5
ubind @mega
uradar enemy any any distance 0 1 res
jump 27 notEqual res null
sensor Yu @unit @y
sensor Xu @unit @x
ulocate building turret true @copper XX YY f RT
sensor rang RT @range
op sub Xxx Xu XX
op sub Yyy Yu YY
op len len Xxx Yyy
op add F F 1
jump 14 greaterThan len rang
op add S S 1
jump 6 lessThan F 100
set F 0
jump 27 greaterThan S 0.1
set S 0
ulocate damaged core true @copper X Y found building
jump 27 equal found 0
sensor I1 building @health
sensor I2 building @maxHealth
jump 18 equal I1 I2
ucontrol approach X Y 21 0 0
ucontrol target X Y 2 0 0
set S 0
jump 1 always x false
ucontrol approach 162 178 8 0 0
set S 0
jump 1 always x false
